ake I requested (vanilla cake with lemon filling and coconut frosting). :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Don&#039;t be afraid to ask for things&amp;nbsp;even if you don&#039;t see what you want on their lists!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894239,"PostDate":1429896278,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just wanted to give an update... Jessica told me that the chef said they can make the cake I requested (vanilla cake with lemon filling and coconut frosting). <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Don't be afraid to ask for things\u00a0even if you don't see what you want on their lists!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402429989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.103.119.195","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by TNT2015, 25 April 2015 - 07:03 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1430017405,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1fcc401a050b74e15f6f32ca9a2af700","RawContent":"Hey ladies, Does anyone know who the resort photographer is now?","Attachments":[],"Id":1894409,"PostDate":1430017376,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies, Does anyone know who the resort photographer is now?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tricey517@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.103.119.195","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422854363,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281976.jpg?_r=1423183212","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TNT2015","Id":281976,"Name":"TNT2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.174.234.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc83b8ceca24757b557f76d048acae95","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TNT2015\"] &amp;nbsp;beach wedding studio&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894424,"PostDate":1430063786,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281976\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281976-tnt2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TNT2015<\/span><\/a> \u00a0beach wedding studio<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"giociviletti@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.229.218.197","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420845388,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281659.jpg?_r=1427573608","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Giocivs88","Id":281659,"Name":"Giocivs88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6af28a8afbfb1c5a27b220b43eb3edf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JenniferH114\"] @[member=\"Sabes44\"] - It&#039;s almost May! Are you both stoked? I was looking at more pics yesterday. One year from Wednesday will be mine. I can&#039;t believe it&#039;s a year away but I know it&#039;ll fly by. You both are going to have a blast!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I requested the pamphlet from Jessica. So I got some of the cake pics you mentioned! Thanks again for lettign me know about this.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Where are you all having your cocktail hour? She requested the beach and sent me a few pics of tables set up.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894553,"PostDate":1430153483,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278395\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278395-jenniferh114\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JenniferH114<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278603\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278603-sabes44\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Sabes44<\/span><\/a> - It's almost May! Are you both stoked? I was looking at more pics yesterday. One year from Wednesday will be mine. I can't believe it's a year away but I know it'll fly by. You both are going to have a blast!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I requested the pamphlet from Jessica. So I got some of the cake pics you mentioned! Thanks again for lettign me know about this.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Where are you all having your cocktail hour? She requested the beach and sent me a few pics of tables set up.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_salv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423178562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriasalv","Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by JenniferH114, 27 April 2015 - 11:05 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1430161557,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"412d254a7abbc0db90b719b6c7213d58","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/&#039; title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;victoriasalv&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Yes, we are pretty much all set (except I still can&#039;t stop buying things!!) and very excited. I&#039;m going to pack up everything we are bringing for the wedding this weekend so I can see where we are at in terms of luggage. In my mind, we are just two weeks away, since I know the Monday and Tuesday before we leave will be a blur with everything that will have to be done (e.g. double checking everything, packing clothes\/personal items, getting nails done, etc.).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are doing a beach ceremony, cocktail hour on the pier and reception at Las Olas.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894572,"PostDate":1430161451,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>victoriasalv<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0- Yes, we are pretty much all set (except I still can't stop buying things!!) and very excited. I'm going to pack up everything we are bringing for the wedding this weekend so I can see where we are at in terms of luggage. In my mind, we are just two weeks away, since I know the Monday and Tuesday before we leave will be a blur with everything that will have to be done (e.g. double checking everything, packing clothes\/personal items, getting nails done, etc.).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are doing a beach ceremony, cocktail hour on the pier and reception at Las Olas.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402429989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9305c312cbf1f538d353a3d3b8f5abec","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;@&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/\" title=\"\"&gt;victoriasalv&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are almost ready. Just had my bachelorette party this weekend, which was a much needed break after moving the week prior. &amp;nbsp;WE just have to finalize the music and finish up the DYI details. &amp;nbsp;But feeling good about everything! &amp;nbsp;After this weekend I am getting really excited and feeling more bridal, its all getting very real!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;@jenniferH114-when do you guys leave?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;We are doing a beach ceremony, cocktail hour at X Lounge and our reception at Las Olas too. &amp;nbsp;I am excited to see someone else doing their reception there, I just thought it was the most perfect, organic spot for what we wanted.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894576,"PostDate":1430163551,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">@<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>victoriasalv<\/a>\u00a0We are almost ready. Just had my bachelorette party this weekend, which was a much needed break after moving the week prior. \u00a0WE just have to finalize the music and finish up the DYI details. \u00a0But feeling good about everything! \u00a0After this weekend I am getting really excited and feeling more bridal, its all getting very real!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">@jenniferH114-when do you guys leave?<\/span><\/p>\n<br \/><p>We are doing a beach ceremony, cocktail hour at X Lounge and our reception at Las Olas too. \u00a0I am excited to see someone else doing their reception there, I just thought it was the most perfect, organic spot for what we wanted.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403212476,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sabes44","Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e3a410671f83be3059128d182fe21f7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278603-sabes44\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sabes44&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;- We leave in the morning on Wednesday, May 13th. I completely agree with you regarding Las Olas. I couldn&#039;t imagine our reception being anywhere else on the property (for what we were looking for).&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894577,"PostDate":1430164025,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278603-sabes44\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>Sabes44<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0- We leave in the morning on Wednesday, May 13th. I completely agree with you regarding Las Olas. I couldn't imagine our reception being anywhere else on the property (for what we were looking for).<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402429989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"785a84f9b69d1f341d3da69a60c73f1b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@JenniferH114-When do you leave Excellence? &amp;nbsp;We are flying in on the 27th!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894580,"PostDate":1430164251,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@JenniferH114-When do you leave Excellence? \u00a0We are flying in on the 27th!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403212476,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sabes44","Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by JenniferH114, 27 April 2015 - 11:59 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1430164766,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02c06fd481c81099a9d2c0eec8739d68","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278603-sabes44\/&#039; title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sabes44&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;- We leave on May 23rd! I&#039;m sure we&#039;ll share stories\/reviews when we both return. I&#039;m feeling pretty good about everything at this point. Jessica has been really great since the start, which is&amp;nbsp;a huge help. Though I am a big planner and I can&amp;nbsp;get a little uptight about certain things,&amp;nbsp;I have been prepping myself&amp;nbsp;for a&amp;nbsp;\"go with the flow\" mentality. lol.\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;PS:&amp;nbsp; Are you getting the complimentary Love Birds spa package? If so, don&#039;t forget to book it. Although, I&#039;m not sure if you really have to book it in advance, but I just did ours last week. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894582,"PostDate":1430164685,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278603-sabes44\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>Sabes44<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0- We leave on May 23rd! I'm sure we'll share stories\/reviews when we both return. I'm feeling pretty good about everything at this point. Jessica has been really great since the start, which is\u00a0a huge help. Though I am a big planner and I can\u00a0get a little uptight about certain things,\u00a0I have been prepping myself\u00a0for a\u00a0\"go with the flow\" mentality. lol.<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>PS:\u00a0 Are you getting the complimentary Love Birds spa package? If so, don't forget to book it. Although, I'm not sure if you really have to book it in advance, but I just did ours last week. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402429989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96f02227e33f8420fb74d3856f3b59b1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JenniferH114\"] Yes, I am sure we will have plenty of reviews and stories! &amp;nbsp;Jessica has been great and I plan events for a living and she hasn&#039;t gotten too tired of me being 100 steps ahead lol. &amp;nbsp;I am giving myself a cut off to get everything done (just the extra \"cute\" stuff) and if I don&#039;t have it all done by then, no one will miss it or even know it didn&#039;t get done (except myself!). &amp;nbsp;So I am doing the same go with the flow attitude, easier said then done, but I am getting better!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yes, we booked our massage and I can&#039;t wait for it! &amp;nbsp;They said they only book them at 7pm each day, did you get the same response?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894594,"PostDate":1430167261,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278395\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278395-jenniferh114\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JenniferH114<\/span><\/a> Yes, I am sure we will have plenty of reviews and stories! \u00a0Jessica has been great and I plan events for a living and she hasn't gotten too tired of me being 100 steps ahead lol. \u00a0I am giving myself a cut off to get everything done (just the extra \"cute\" stuff) and if I don't have it all done by then, no one will miss it or even know it didn't get done (except myself!). \u00a0So I am doing the same go with the flow attitude, easier said then done, but I am getting better!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yes, we booked our massage and I can't wait for it! \u00a0They said they only book them at 7pm each day, did you get the same response?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403212476,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sabes44","Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"64583","Title":"Excellence Riviera Cancun Brides?","LastPostDate":1430228087},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1174,"TotalPages":118,"CurrentPage":1160,"NextPage":1170,"PreviousPage":1150,"LastPage":1170},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
